{"legislative_session": "119", "identifier": "HR 2483", "title": "SUPPORT for Patients and Communities Reauthorization Act of 2025", "from_organization": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["bill"], "subject": [], "abstracts": [], "other_titles": [{"note": "", "title": "To reauthorize certain programs that provide for opioid use disorder prevention, treatment, and recovery, and for other purposes."}], "other_identifiers": [{"identifier": "ocd-bill-us-119-hr2483"}], "actions": [{"description": "Introduced in House", "date": "2025-03-31T04:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["introduction"], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Referred to the Committee on Energy and Commerce, and in addition to the Committees on Education and Workforce, the Judiciary, and Financial Services, for a period to be subsequently determined by the Speaker, in each case for consideration of such provisions as fall within the jurisdiction of the committee concerned.", "date": "2025-03-31T04:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["referral-committee"], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Committee Consideration and Mark-up Session Held", "date": "2025-04-29T04:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Ordered to be Reported (Amended) by the Yeas and Nays: 36 - 13.", "date": "2025-04-29T04:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Reported (Amended) by the Committee on Energy and Commerce. H. Rept. 119-114, Part I.", "date": "2025-05-29T04:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Committee on Education and Workforce discharged.", "date": "2025-05-29T04:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Committee on the Judiciary discharged.", "date": "2025-05-29T04:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Committee on Financial Services discharged.", "date": "2025-05-29T04:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Placed on the Union Calendar, Calendar No. 84.", "date": "2025-05-29T04:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 458 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 2483, H.R. 2931, H.R. 2966 and H.R. 2987. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 2483 under a structured rule and for consideration of H.R. 2931, H.R. 2966, and H.R. 2987 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for one hour of debate and one motion to recommit on each bill.", "date": "2025-06-03T23:20:02+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 458. (consideration: CR H2441-2456; text: CR H2447-2543)", "date": "2025-06-04T18:09:15+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 2483, H.R. 2931, H.R. 2966 and H.R. 2987. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 2483 under a structured rule and for consideration of H.R. 2931, H.R. 2966, and H.R. 2987 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for one hour of debate and one motion to recommit on each bill.", "date": "2025-06-04T18:09:20+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "House resolved itself into the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union pursuant to H. Res. 458 and Rule XVIII.", "date": "2025-06-04T18:09:36+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "The Speaker designated the Honorable Scott DesJarlais to act as Chairman of the Committee.", "date": "2025-06-04T18:09:37+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "GENERAL DEBATE - The Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of general debate on H.R. 2483.", "date": "2025-06-04T18:10:04+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 458, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Bresnahan amendment No. 1.", "date": "2025-06-04T19:05:45+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 458, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Kiggans (VA) amendment No. 2.", "date": "2025-06-04T19:08:45+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 458, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Pettersen amendment No. 3.", "date": "2025-06-04T19:11:32+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on the Pettersen amendment, the Chair put the question on agreeing to the amendment and by voice vote, announced the noes had prevailed. Ms. Pettersen demanded a recorded vote, and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.", "date": "2025-06-04T19:21:52+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.Res. 458, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Wittman amendment No. 4.", "date": "2025-06-04T19:22:49+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Mr. Wittman moved that the committee rise.", "date": "2025-06-04T19:27:11+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "On motion that the committee rise Agreed to by voice vote.", "date": "2025-06-04T19:27:26+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union rises leaving H.R. 2483 as unfinished business.", "date": "2025-06-04T19:27:37+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H2456-2457)", "date": "2025-06-04T20:30:54+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "The House resolved into Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union for further consideration.", "date": "2025-06-04T20:31:15+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "The House rose from the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union to report H.R. 2483.", "date": "2025-06-04T21:01:31+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": [], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.", "date": "2025-06-04T21:02:14+00:00", "organizatio